Output: 3
Explanation: The given linked list is 1->2->3->4->5 and its middle is 3.
   
Input:
   /* Linked List Node Structure
class Node {
    int data;
    Node next;

    Node(int x) {
        data = x;
        next = null;
    }
} */

class Solution {
    int getMiddle(Node head) {
        Node slow=head;
        Node fast=head;
        while(fast!=null && fast.next!=null){
            slow=slow.next;
            fast=fast.next.next;
        }
        return slow.data;
        
    }
}
